{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会in幕張メッセ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恒例の抽選会、自己紹介\n前の全握でもフルネーム\n言い忘れてしまいました..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/05/9171716/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/05/9171716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかはー？\n＼どうがーん／\nだけど大人だもん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...のみで終わってました。\nはあー気をつけなきゃー><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、15㎝切ったけど髪型\nほめてくれたんか気づいたんか\nわからんけどよかったってことで♪←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抽選会の乃木神社の絵馬"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/05/9171716/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たった方おめでとうございました。\n願い事叶うといいなあ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージがパワーアップしてたね！\n広くなって大きいモニター2つも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/05/9171716/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！\nびっくりしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪指望遠鏡\n♪春のメロディー\n♪渋谷ブルース\n♪やさしさなら間に合ってる\n♪制服のマネキン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷ブルースで\nまいやんとかずみが着てる\n「WHITE HIGH」Tシャツの\nダメージ加工私がやったんだよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/05/9171716/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったらそこも注目してねー^^\nというかあのTシャツ普通に欲しい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\nライブ後の握手会。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ゆったんまりっかレーン／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/05/9171716/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2013年初握手ということで\n盛り上がったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/05/9171716/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめましての方が\nたくさん来てくださって\nめっちゃ嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁみたんのみなさん\nまりっ会のみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/05/9171716/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しかったー\nゆったん机動かし過ぎ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったから喉がらがらやわ！\nやばい！明日個握あるのに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/05/9171716/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握も楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/05/9171716/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部4部5部だよ。\n3部4部はこの間買った服着る^^\n5部で服装変えようかな～\nなにしよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるからね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/05/9171716/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/05/9171716/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}